<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\SlimDep.Analysis\SlimDep.Analysis.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\SlimDep.Core\SlimDep.Core.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="System.CommandLine" Version="2.0.9" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="SlimDep.UnitTests" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- Include README and icon in the NuGet package -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <AssemblyName>slimdep</AssemblyName>

    <!-- Tool settings -->
    <PackAsTool>true</PackAsTool>
    <ToolCommandName>slimdep</ToolCommandName>
    <!-- Built for net8.0; let it run on newer runtimes (machines with only .NET 9 or 10 installed) -->
    <RollForward>Major</RollForward>

    <!-- Package identity -->
    <PackageId>SlimDep</PackageId>
    <Version>1.2.1</Version>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/vinaydiddi/SlimDep</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/vinaydiddi/SlimDep</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <Description>Detect and remove unused NuGet package references in .NET projects.</Description>
    <PackageTags>nuget;dotnet-tool;unused;dependencies;packages;csproj;analyzer;cleanup;remove;detect;roslyn;static-analysis;sarif;package-reference;unused-packages;dependency-cleanup;dotnet;tool;net8;slim;nuget-cleanup;unused-nuget;dependency-analyzer;github-code-scanning</PackageTags>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>1.2.1 — Safety fixes (upgrade recommended; 1.2.0 was never published).

fix no longer removes packages that are actually used via: #elif branches, global:: calls, lower-case root namespaces (log4net), linked Compile items and shared .projitems, XAML using:/.axaml, Razor @inject/@model/@inherits/@attribute/@code, conditional Using/ImplicitUsings, or projects located under a folder named bin/obj. Version pins are checked per target framework.

Also: byte-for-byte project-file edits (UTF-16, code pages, quotes, entities preserved); project.assets.json found via UseArtifactsOutput/BaseIntermediateOutputPath; unexpected errors exit 2 without losing other projects' results; transitive-only findings no longer fail scan; 'ignore add' no longer merges entries; runs on .NET 9/10-only machines.

1.2.0 (included) — SLIMDEP002 (transitive packages used directly), version-pin detection, built-in safe list (--no-default-ignores), --fail-on-undeclared, new JSON arrays undeclaredPackages / pinnedPackages / skippedPackages.

Full history: https://github.com/vinaydiddi/SlimDep/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
